### Calidad pedagógica en 4 idiomas (es, en, fr, it), 3 dificultades y categorías dinámicas
@baseUrl = http://localhost:57011/api/v1
@email = qa-4langs-{{$timestamp}}@example.com
@password = QaPassword123!

### 8.1 Registro con dolly_pro y categorías dinámicas personalizadas
# @name reg
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "QA Four Languages Quality"
}

@token = {{reg.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly_pro"
}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": ["Música Clásica", "Gastronomía Molecular", "Quantum Computing", "Arquitectura Gótica"]
}

### 8.2 Español - Fácil (A1-A2) con categoría dinámica con acentos -> revisar vocabulario y coherencia
# @name esEasy
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Gastronomía Molecular",
  "language": "es",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "size": "short"
}

### Pedir explicación de vocabulario en español
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{esEasy.response.body.data.id}}/explanations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "word": "emulsión",
  "context": "{{esEasy.response.body.data.description}}"
}

### Evaluar lectura española (libera pendiente #1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{esEasy.response.body.data.id}}/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userResponse": "El texto explica de forma sencilla cómo técnicas científicas transforman texturas en la cocina."
}

### 8.3 Inglés - Medio (B1-B2)
# @name enMed
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Quantum Computing",
  "language": "en",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "size": "medium"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{enMed.response.body.data.id}}/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userResponse": "The reading explains how quantum principles and qubits solve specialized computational problems."
}

### 8.4 Francés - Medio/Difícil con categoría dinámica -> comprobar coherencia, acentos y léxico francés
# @name frHard
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Música Clásica",
  "language": "fr",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "size": "long"
}

### Pedir explicación de vocabulario en francés
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{frHard.response.body.data.id}}/explanations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "word": "harmonie"
}

### Evaluar lectura francesa
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{frHard.response.body.data.id}}/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userResponse": "Le texte analyse la structure harmonique et l'évolution historique de la musique classique."
}

### 8.5 Italiano vía POST /content/generate (sin especificar category, usa categoría dinámica del usuario)
# @name itContent
POST {{baseUrl}}/content/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "it",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "size": "medium"
}

### Pedir explicación de vocabulario en italiano
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{itContent.response.body.data.id}}/explanations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "word": "struttura"
}

### Evaluar lectura italiana
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{itContent.response.body.data.id}}/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userResponse": "L'articolo esplora le caratteristiche tecniche e il vocabolario fondamentale dell'argomento."
}
